      "content": "i mean i know u should see a doctor but i really dont have the time or the money for appointments right now. it mostly just feels like my head is spinning and i'm just \"zoned out.\" do u think there's anything i can take or do at home to just clear the fog so i can focus again? like maybe a certain supplement or something?",
